Z||000004||Haze_Performance||09-06-2000||12:22 PM||||Hi Oreif,<P>Im talking about the 2 round ones on the bottom. The guy the parked next to me at the GTO show (Pace Car) had them on his. His came that way.<BR>  ||||reg||5
