Z||000010||Uaana||09-06-2000||09:46 PM||||Since were on the subject. <BR>Just recently my arm rest has been seperating from the door. I pull the door shut and the upper part of the handle seperates from the door. <BR>Now Ive pulled the screw and reseated the plug and then put the screw back in. still dont work right.<BR>Any suggestions?||||reg||5
Z||000011||Monkeyman||09-06-2000||09:57 PM||||Try a larger screw (diameter, not length).||||reg||1
Z||000012||HugGRRRFiero||09-06-2000||10:35 PM||||Uaana, I responded with some info to your other post.  Also, take the armrest off and check to make sure the nylon thingy that the screw goes into isn't stripped or going bad.<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">  <BR>  <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||3
